      "side": 1,
      "message": "`mode\u003d0o644` as a default for a generic helper is a little loose: `make_instackenv_json.py` embeds `pm_user` and `pm_password` in every node entry, so the file this copies carries IPMI/Foreman credentials. `/root` is normally 0700, and `clouddata` does the same `chmod 644`, so this is defence-in-depth rather than a live leak — but I\u0027d default `put_file` to 0o600 and let callers ask for 0o644 explicitly.",
      "revId": "2321d9432a06a85f601099bc97e504155f434894",
      "serverId": "d5d70762-12d0-45a1-890d-524b12d3f735"
    },
