      "writtenOn": "2026-10-20T11:54:23Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If `chmod` alone fails (some sftp servers reject it for a non-owner, or the server aborts the channel after the write), `put_file` returns False even though the content is already on disk. `_deliver_files` then reports failure and skips the second inventory file, so a fully usable pair ends up as one file plus an error in the dayzero log. chmod is best-effort here; I\u0027d log a warning and still return True.",
      "revId": "2321d9432a06a85f601099bc97e504155f434894",
